#: ../userguides/mapflow_auth.rst:4 7aad30b67ed84d0bbdcbe9694ae3c00e
msgid "Authorization to Mapflow API"
msgstr "Mapflow API 授权"

#: ../userguides/mapflow_auth.rst:6 781af99a323642b5b20c34eed812b47d
msgid ""
"To access from external applications such as :doc:`plugin for QGIS "
"<../api/qgis_mapflow>` you need to get **API token**. Users can register and"
" obtain token at `https://app.mapflow.ai/account/api "
"<https://app.mapflow.ai/account/api>`_. Token must be passed in the **Basic "
"Auth** parameters like in the example:"
msgstr ""
"要从外部应用程序访问，例如:doc:`QGIS 插件 <../api/qgis_mapflow>`，您需要获取 **API "
"令牌**。用户可以在`https://app.mapflow.ai/account/api "
"<https://app.mapflow.ai/account/api>`_注册并获取令牌。令牌必须在 **Basic Auth** "
"参数中传递，如示例所示："

#: ../userguides/mapflow_auth.rst:17 e4ba77a4306f4de6bec0f75d4deb0919
msgid ""
"Your token is generated by request and composed of `<Email: API Token>`"
msgstr "您的令牌是根据请求生成的，由“<Email: API Token>”组成"

#: ../userguides/mapflow_auth.rst:19 ffad551248d245d89e34693917bd2fa9
msgid ""
"You can decode it `with base64 decoder <https://www.base64decoder.io/>`_ to "
"use in Basic Auth form"
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 base64 解码器 <https://www.base64decoder.io/>`_ 对其进行解码，以在基本身份验证表单中使用"

#: ../userguides/mapflow_auth.rst:21 0367d0cea4944d6096aa4ea46d0bf4a0
msgid "Make sure you save the token, otherwise you will need to reissue it."
msgstr "请务必保存令牌，否则您将需要重新颁发它。"

#: ../userguides/mapflow_auth.rst:24 645e821e89ad4e42a2e456cbddfad87b
msgid "Obtaining an API token"
msgstr "获取API令牌"

#: ../userguides/mapflow_auth.rst:26 c5f4a333959b4e59807074eccd2e96cc
msgid ""
"Open the web application `Mapflow <https://app.mapflow.ai>`_. Register a new"
" account or sign in using your Google account."
msgstr ""
"打开 Web 应用程序“Mapflow <https://app.mapflow.ai>”_。注册新帐户或使用您的 Google 帐户登录。"

#: ../userguides/mapflow_auth.rst:28 b2c12e581068450a867d28b4f2d9336f
msgid ""
"Go to `user profile settings <https://app.mapflow.ai/account>`_ to generate "
"a new API token."
msgstr "转到“用户配置文件设置 <https://app.mapflow.ai/account>”_ 以生成新的 API 令牌。"

#: cc43016f81ff4a7192e87928580c178f
msgid "Preview map"
msgstr "预览地图"
